{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Airport Baggage Simulator</strong> \u2013 My name is G\u00fcnther Gewinn and I'm the boss here! Recently, a position opened up because our previous baggage handler, Rolf, decided to change careers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/a29d5130a93ea4916364313640834417.avif?t=1761310411\" width=780 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Baggage comes in one by one: You pick them up, place them on the table, scan them green or red depending on whether the label is correct, and then place them on the appropriate exit conveyor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/ca9f7149dd586fe399601c484a473b94.poster.avif?t=1761310411\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/ca9f7149dd586fe399601c484a473b94.webm?t=1761310411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/ca9f7149dd586fe399601c484a473b94.mp4?t=1761310411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/0992ffac3e4c2806dd140d024e22732f.avif?t=1761310411\" width=780 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our most reliable employee, Horst, is responsible for delivering packages. Everything you order on your tablet will be delivered by him in no time and in top quality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/2185d8437ebb15346061cb3d29bfb31e.poster.avif?t=1761310411\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/2185d8437ebb15346061cb3d29bfb31e.webm?t=1761310411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/2185d8437ebb15346061cb3d29bfb31e.mp4?t=1761310411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/18aa86dc20e4e1e581d40419ae4a4299.avif?t=1761310411\" width=780 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can unlock licenses for new checks on your tablet. For example, weighing suitcases or using the Substance Sniffer. Each new license brings you more income and variety in your workday.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/dcbbffc6c9fc78c597f6478584ca6c11.poster.avif?t=1761310411\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/dcbbffc6c9fc78c597f6478584ca6c11.webm?t=1761310411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/dcbbffc6c9fc78c597f6478584ca6c11.mp4?t=1761310411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/f7c276d7792455bf87963204253dbc64.avif?t=1761310411\" width=780 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually, you let the machines handle control and sorting: Baggage is launched through the air by a launcher module onto the next belt and sorted by an automatic scanner without you having to intervene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/411bb16e6d0a37142f9a52112c726f65.poster.avif?t=1761310411\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/411bb16e6d0a37142f9a52112c726f65.webm?t=1761310411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/411bb16e6d0a37142f9a52112c726f65.mp4?t=1761310411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/9862b872a9d3f9d0e576efa0f03205a0.avif?t=1761310411\" width=780 height=104 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Checks &amp; Automation:</strong> You start with manual controls and later build machines that take over every step.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conveyor Layout:</strong> Plan and build your own conveyor belt lines to efficiently route baggage to the right checks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades &amp; Staff:</strong> Upgrade Horst, speed up the Substance Sniffer, and install automatic approval gates or a wall breakthrough to the delivery room.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Destinations:</strong> Unlock new destination airports, expand the area, and increase the capacity of your gates and systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Baggage Types:</strong> Unlock different types of baggage for higher earnings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Commission:</strong> Your payout rises when you ensure flight safety and deliver baggage on time \u2013 efficiency pays off.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/0a5d9a2e5a71ea73a294275dca2b5b15.avif?t=1761310411\" width=780 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you've read this far, I have a feeling you're just the right person for this job. Congratulations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ute Gutgelaunt</strong> from HR will send you all important info via email on your first day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm looking forward to your first day at work. Always remember: <u>Airport operations tolerate no negligence!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Best regards,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>G\u00fcnther Gewinn</strong><br><br>-Management</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3887090?t=1761310411","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/e54130d5969c120ee541f54eb5cf5d31cecca253/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761310411","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/9ee01179eb7b0ad65255f6021c50c62199e143a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761310411","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/9ee01179eb7b0ad65255f6021c50c62199e143a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761310411","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3893960,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Airport Baggage Simulator</strong> \u2013 My name is G\u00fcnther Gewinn and I'm the boss here! Recently, a position opened up because our previous baggage handler, Rolf, decided to change careers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/a29d5130a93ea4916364313640834417.avif?t=1761310411\" width=780 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Baggage comes in one by one: You pick them up, place them on the table, scan them green or red depending on whether the label is correct, and then place them on the appropriate exit conveyor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/ca9f7149dd586fe399601c484a473b94.poster.avif?t=1761310411\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/ca9f7149dd586fe399601c484a473b94.webm?t=1761310411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/ca9f7149dd586fe399601c484a473b94.mp4?t=1761310411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/0992ffac3e4c2806dd140d024e22732f.avif?t=1761310411\" width=780 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our most reliable employee, Horst, is responsible for delivering packages. Everything you order on your tablet will be delivered by him in no time and in top quality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/2185d8437ebb15346061cb3d29bfb31e.poster.avif?t=1761310411\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/2185d8437ebb15346061cb3d29bfb31e.webm?t=1761310411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/2185d8437ebb15346061cb3d29bfb31e.mp4?t=1761310411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/18aa86dc20e4e1e581d40419ae4a4299.avif?t=1761310411\" width=780 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can unlock licenses for new checks on your tablet. For example, weighing suitcases or using the Substance Sniffer. Each new license brings you more income and variety in your workday.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/dcbbffc6c9fc78c597f6478584ca6c11.poster.avif?t=1761310411\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/dcbbffc6c9fc78c597f6478584ca6c11.webm?t=1761310411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/dcbbffc6c9fc78c597f6478584ca6c11.mp4?t=1761310411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/f7c276d7792455bf87963204253dbc64.avif?t=1761310411\" width=780 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually, you let the machines handle control and sorting: Baggage is launched through the air by a launcher module onto the next belt and sorted by an automatic scanner without you having to intervene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"