d.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/0a5d9a2e5a71ea73a294275dca2b5b15.avif?t=1761310411\" width=780 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you've read this far, I have a feeling you're just the right person for this job. Congratulations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ute Gutgelaunt</strong> from HR will send you all important info via email on your first day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm looking forward to your first day at work. Always remember: <u>Airport operations tolerate no negligence!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Best regards,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>G\u00fcnther Gewinn</strong><br><br>-Management</p>","developers":["Three River Games (3RG)"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/747323dfd16b7e6ace2319810ddb908cb2fcac89/header.jpg?t=1761310411","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"(c) 2025 Three River Games.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3887090/1365535145/96d5b23334558af0ee090106419d62c920cde29c/1755701355/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756814355","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3887090/1365535145/96d5b23334558af0ee090106419d62c920cde29c/1755701355/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756814355","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3887090/1365535145/96d5b23334558af0ee090106419d62c920cde29c/1755701355/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756814355","id":257186108,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_t